        "summary": "Founded in 1994 in Philadelphia by former stunt coordinator Danny Vance, the Xtreme Wrestling Federation became the edgy alternative to mainstream wrestling through hardcore matches and extreme stipulations. Operating on the independent circuit throughout the 1990s-2000s, XWF cultivated a cult following for its willingness to push boundaries and prioritize spectacle over tradition. ",
