        "character": "Laid-back martial arts showman who treats every match like a highlight reel.",
        "story": "Born into a working-class family in the United States, Ron Van Dude turned to professional wrestling as both escape and ambition, making 1990 the year everything changed. Known for a breathtaking high-flying arsenal, Ron Van Dude carved an identity as an unpredictable wildcard whose 420 Splash has put countless opponents away in emphatic fashion. Now a main-event calibre competitor at British Stronghold, Ron Van Dude has cemented a place near the top of the card, with championship glory firmly in his sights. He is a battle-tested veteran carrying scar tissue as proof of longevity.",
