        "character": "Obsessive risk-taker who reinvents himself to stay relevant.",
        "story": "After years training in obscurity across the gyms and independents of the United States, Rick Cole finally stepped into the spotlight in 2000, and never looked back. A beloved fan favourite who relies on a punishing complete, no-weakness skill set, Rick Cole uses the devastating Cole Crusher as the exclamation point on performance after performance. At British Stronghold, Rick Cole operates at the top of the card as a reliable mid-card talent whose best years may still be ahead. He is at an age where instinct and conditioning finally meet experience.",
