        "character": "Artistic, self-destructive high-flyer who treats every match like a canvas.",
        "story": "Cam Cole's path to professional wrestling was unconventional—a late bloomer who debuted in 2002 after years of false starts and determination in the United States. Deploying a top-rope daredevil repertoire that leaves crowds breathless, the beloved fan favourite Cam Cole has made the Skyfall Swanton one of the most feared moves on the roster. Whether chasing gold or defending earned status, the reliable mid-card Cam Cole remains one of the most compelling figures at British Stronghold, holding court at the top of the card. He is hitting a stride that only comes once the learning curve flattens out.",
